SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Sandbox SMD Applications on Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Sandbox SMD Applications on Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00.\n\nDuring the outage users will not be able to connect to the following Sandbox SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load\, and Financial Assurance Management.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165879
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165879
